			"Message": "build(Wind): Bump generated catalog version dates\n\nRe-run the Wind codegen pipeline as part of the daily contract refresh cycle. The `CommandCatalogVersion` and `ServiceCatalogVersion` constants advance to `2026-05-24`, reflecting today's generation run. No new commands or services were introduced — totals remain at 551 commands and 500 services — so this update is tracking only the generation timestamp.\n\nThe `tsconfig.tsbuildinfo` file was regenerated as a consequence of the composite build configuration enabled in the prior commit. This ensures incremental builds remain consistent with the current tsconfig settings.\n\nThese changes maintain alignment between generated artifacts and the refresh schedule.",
